Per-Yee-point susceptibility-sigma reader for MEEP, mirroring get_chi1inv.

Adds to libmeep (no SWIG changes -- %include "meep.hpp" wraps the new
declarations, and the std::vector<double> out-typemap predates the include):

  fields/structure::get_num_susceptibilities(field_type)   -> chain length
  fields/structure::get_susceptibility_params(ft, n)       -> dump_params' payload
  fields/structure/chunks::get_susceptibility_sigma(c,d,iloc,n) -> per-point sigma
  susceptibility::get_params_list()                        -> in-memory dump_params

Written against the meep-1.33.0 release tarball; applied by
build_meep_133_macos.sh when MEEP_SIGMA_PATCH=1.  Carried into MEEP's own tree,
python/tests/test_get_susceptibility_sigma.py would also be registered in
python/Makefile.am, with a NEWS.md line.

